==English==

===Noun===
'''upstart'''

# someone who has [[gained]] [[sudden]] [[wealth]], [[power]] or [[influence]], but has either not gained [[social]] [[acceptance]] or has become [[arrogant]] or [[presumptuous]]

====Synonyms====
